---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "Terms of Service & Medical Disclaimer | FreeMaintenanceCaloriesCalculator.com";
const description = "Terms of service, usage guidelines, and medical disclaimer for FreeMaintenanceCaloriesCalculator.com.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16">
    <div class="border-b border-hairline pb-8 mb-10">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-mute" style="font-family: var(--font-mono);">Terms & Disclaimers</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-ink tracking-tight mt-1 mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-mute">Last updated: September 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 text-body text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
      
      <!-- Prominent Medical Disclaimer Box -->
      <div class="bg-canvas-elevated border-2 border-amber-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-xs">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-amber-600">⚠️</span> Medical & Dietary Disclaimer
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-body leading-relaxed mb-3">
          The content, calculators, and estimations provided on FreeMaintenanceCaloriesCalculator.com are generated for educational, informational, and general fitness purposes only.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-body leading-relaxed">
          This service does not constitute medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. Never disregard professional medical advice or delay seeking it because of something you have read or calculated on this website. Always consult a physician, registered dietitian, or qualified healthcare professional prior to initiating any rigorous calorie restriction, weight loss program, or intense exercise routine.
        </p>
      </div>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing or using FreeMaintenanceCaloriesCalculator.com, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service and all applicable laws and regulations. If you do not agree with any of these terms, you are prohibited from using or accessing this site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">2. Use License & Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          Permission is granted to temporarily use the materials and interactive tools on FreeMaintenanceCaloriesCalculator.com for personal, non-commercial transitory viewing only. You may not modify or copy the materials, use the materials for any commercial purpose without prior written consent, or attempt to decompile or reverse engineer any software contained on the platform.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">3. Accuracy of Estimations</h2>
        <p>
          While our calculators utilize peer-reviewed clinical formulas (including Mifflin-St Jeor, Katch-McArdle, and Harris-Benedict equations), all calculated outputs represent mathematical approximations. Individual energy expenditure varies based on genetics, hormonal health, adaptive thermogenesis, and lifestyle factors. FreeMaintenanceCaloriesCalculator.com does not warrant that any calculations are exact or error-free.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          In no event shall FreeMaintenanceCaloriesCalculator.com, its developers, or contributors be liable for any damages (including, without limitation, damages for loss of health, personal injury, data loss, or profit) arising out of the use or inability to use the materials on this website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-ink mb-2">5. External Links</h2>
        <p>
          FreeMaintenanceCaloriesCalculator.com may contain links to third-party websites or services that are not owned or controlled by us. We assume no responsibility for the content, privacy policies, or practices of any third-party websites.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
